  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat._Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c67ccba92e9216780ae2f8/step-cb5e6140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop tomato and cucumber. Grate carrot. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine tomato and cucumber. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and toss. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c67ccba92e9216780ae2f8/step-d36ab7e3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Stir in tomato paste, garlic and Jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add red kidney beans (including liquid from tin) and the butter and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins. Season with to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c67ccba92e9216780ae2f8/step-9dcb62a0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between bowls.\n• Top with kidney bean mixture and shredded Cheddar.\n• Serve with salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c67ccba92e9216780ae2f8/step-b6b735e5.jpg"
    }
  ]
